&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation and benefits aligned with APAC market standards&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
